title: "Design and Development of a CAN FD Fault Injector for a Software-Defined-Vehicle Platform"
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-07"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23667575
repository-code: "https://github.com/Tabzeen/CAN-FD-FI"
